    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d151">

                <pb facs="d150-2" n="2" sameAs="frus:frus1958-60v03mSupp/d150-2"/>

                <head>151. Memorandum From Lay to the NSC<anchor n="1" xml:id="d151-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1959-04-21">April 21, 1959</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d151-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d151-1"/>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Status of Military Mobilization Base Program</item>
                </list>
                <list type="references">
                    <head>REFERENCES</head>
                    <item>A. NSC 5810/1</item>
                    <item>B. NSC Action No. 2019</item>
                </list>
                <p>The enclosed memorandum on the subject from the Deputy Secretary of Defense,
                    prepared pursuant to NSC Action No. 2019–<hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>–(1) <pb
                        facs="0799" n="694" type="typeset" xml:id="pg694"/> and –(2), is transmitted
                    herewith for the information of the National Security Council.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">James S. Lay, Jr.</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Executive Secretary</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>cc: The Secretary of the Treasury</p>
                    <p>The Director, Bureau of the Budget</p>
                    <p>The Chairman, Joint Chiefs of Staff</p>
                    <p>The Director of Central Intelligence</p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d151-a1.xml" xpointer="d151-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d151-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d151-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Transmits a memorandum from Quarles to the NSC on “Status of Military
                    Mobilization Base Program.” Secret. 2 pp. NARA, RG 59, S/P–NSC Files: Lot 62 D
                    1, NSC 5810, 5906.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
